    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abc6c41b7fd8c1125471f1f7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呵……嗯，你就好好努力练习一下\n如何展现自己的魅力吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb4517f48fa2f7d07fb40370bcd112519693003a091d20837bcb8f99c04e1e8b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
