    {
      "uid": "zhcn:996c08724bcd8b25a81cbc3d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "外套则采用了“贴身剪裁”\n──几乎没有多余的地方，\n打造出时尚的现代剪影。",
      "source_fingerprint": "02e8c105598ca8f6aa38df4e9711e9539a9ce433e6140317cb6aa7e80908883c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
