    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3056ac3b5eda51754d2d0451",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我为了拜访天狼星象征，来到她的教室。\n因为某种原因，这一天我也因紧张而\n绷紧了神经，结果……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7dfa5292c40f0a71332e45d1cf1deb0dba735351edb2669e54068bf9a23d3d2c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070514.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66285e532b19a4a4bf982ff3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天狼星象征",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ec317440b52f89fbdfad76110a7afc3ac55b01c91d67997968e5ba969bc9ea2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070514.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4528ef39a4a8fef6e4dc6bcc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那个世界被封闭了起来。\n……男人非常憎恨那些毁掉妹妹的人。\n然后他抱着妹妹这么说──",
      "source_fingerprint": "5034551eb9f50f3dc62d6e01584671163eaf825f16dbcdaa6c4b4f914ec36539",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070514.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31aa882ce562baa553177804",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天狼星象征",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ec317440b52f89fbdfad76110a7afc3ac55b01c91d67997968e5ba969bc9ea2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070514.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a1cdb3fbb624cd202189c28",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“我要毁掉……让那些家伙，像我妹妹一样……\n我要把那些家伙全都消灭……！”",
      "source_fingerprint": "8cbe320145aa3b912d0031abe5d113bc0796e07d6a8f3e00a85d16402172cbba",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070514.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e3352357ddcee8f67e575d2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天狼星象征",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ec317440b52f89fbdfad76110a7afc3ac55b01c91d67997968e5ba969bc9ea2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070514.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "name"
      ],
