    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24cc5bbad5dca8b466752f6c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“生下他们的父母，溺爱他们的父母，\n一同欢笑的兄弟，没认清他们本性的无能宠物，\n不阻止他们的朋友，让他们得意忘形的恋人──”",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1424ec40e1b0091f3adf9e45595a8055bef67e22546303bff19ef7cf7259aa9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070514.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a4845b11f7e1775965b6484",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天狼星象征",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ec317440b52f89fbdfad76110a7afc3ac55b01c91d67997968e5ba969bc9ea2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070514.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c728465ea673162d95a2a4e8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“装成好孩子的邻居，温柔的店员。\n赋予那些家伙们智慧和傲慢的一切，\n让他们变得无情和无能的一切……！”",
      "source_fingerprint": "40a6d1d004ca07eaae773e125bce8c587d586c9794a0dcbc2d7e4578f79d1354",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070514.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b9ed8fe07c206b9087f0bb9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这、这是不是有点太过分了……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "28fe9e42fb9ce03f75b9476f3e2e1e42a826e376ab5d7bb776b56628c9af93a5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070514.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45b548340db6170e884fbbd1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天狼星象征",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ec317440b52f89fbdfad76110a7afc3ac55b01c91d67997968e5ba969bc9ea2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070514.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
